<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79696" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάροικος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dwelling beside</i> or
				<i>near, neighbouring</i>, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κάδμου πάροικοι . . δόμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1155
				</span></i>
			 ; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεις]π.Ρῃκίων ἐπαύλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					869
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.) : c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμῷ παροίκους
				Ἅλυϊ</span> Diog.Trag.<i><span class="en">
				1.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.113
			</span></i> : abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. πηλαμύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					503
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>neighbour</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀσίνης
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				80
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀττικὸς π</span>., prov. of a
			restless neighbour, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1395a18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Duris
				96J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πόλεμος</span> war <i>with
			neighbours</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.235
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>foreign, alien</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				15.13
			</span></i>, al. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρμα π. ἐν γῇ ἀλλοτρίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					7.6
				</span></i>
			 : as Subst., <i>sojourner</i> in another's
			house, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				1.82
			</span></i> : generally, <i>alien, stranger</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				22.10
			</span></i> : in later Greek, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτοικος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				398.37
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.2712.64
			</span></i> (Acraeph.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				1338.12
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				20
			</span></i>, al.(Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), etc.; =
			<i>colonus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cod.Just.
				1.34.1
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
